  "post_content": "<p>L&rsquo;escriptor Josep Arrandis Garcia, de Suera, ha presentat els seus dos libres infantils, El m&oacute;n de Pao i El somriure de Panxo, a la biblioteca de Ribesalbes.</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2022/04/IMG_20220427_173017.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p><p>Arrandis &eacute;s tamb&eacute; l&rsquo;agent d&rsquo;Igualtat de la Mancomunitat Espad&agrave; Millars, ra&oacute; per la qual l&rsquo;acompanyava la regidora de Serveis Socials i Igualtat de l&rsquo;Ajuntament de Ribesalbes, Susana Bol&oacute;s G&oacute;mez.</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2022/04/IMG_20220427_173118.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 361px;\" /></p><p>La presentaci&oacute; s&rsquo;ha fet de forma molt amena, amb la participaci&oacute; activa de la xiquets i xiquetes que omplien totalment la sala.</p><p></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenllibresjoseparrandisribesalbes/IMG_20220427_173015.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20220427_173015\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenllibresjoseparrandisribesalbes/IMG_20220427_173017.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20220427_173017\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenllibresjoseparrandisribesalbes/IMG_20220427_173036.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20220427_173036\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenllibresjoseparrandisribesalbes/IMG_20220427_173041.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20220427_173041\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenllibresjoseparrandisribesalbes/IMG_20220427_173114.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20220427_173114\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-9